<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;WILHELM WÖHRL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Wilhelm Wöhrl is an ironmonger with a fascination for art, owning a workshop filled with tools and a portrait of Christiaan Josi."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0082</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHRISTIAAN JOSI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Christiaan Josi is the subject of a portrait, possibly painted by Pieter Christoffel Wonder, whose identity is debated."&lt;SEP&gt;"Christiaan Josi is the subject of the portrait, likely the person depicted in the artwork."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0082</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PIETER CHRISTOFFEL WONDER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pieter Christoffel Wonder is a 17th-century Dutch artist known for his mastery of light and shadow, and the creator of the portrait of Christiaan Josi."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0082</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FONDATION CUSTODIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fondation Custodia is a cultural institution that displays the 'Portrait of a man, probably Christiaan Josi' and other masterpieces."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fondation Custodia is a prestigious art foundation in Paris, France, that preserves and exhibits Netherlandish art, including the portrait of Christiaan Josi."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0082</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRIZ LUGT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Friz Lugt is a Dutch art connoisseur and collector who assembled the core collection of the Fondation Custodia, including the portrait of Christiaan Josi."&lt;SEP&gt;"Friz Lugt is the donor or collector of the artwork mentioned in the text."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0082</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PARIS, FRANCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Paris, France is the location of the Fondation Custodia, where the portrait of Christiaan Josi is displayed."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0082</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PORTRAIT OF A MAN, PROBABLY CHRISTIAAN JOSI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ARTWORK"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Portrait of a man, probably Christiaan Josi is a significant piece in the collection, serving as a centerpiece."&lt;SEP&gt;"The portrait is a masterpiece by Pieter Christoffel Wonder, depicting a man with a strong jawline and piercing eyes, and is now housed in the Fondation Custodia."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0082</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANVIL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ARTIFACT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An anvil is a tool used by Wilhelm Wöhrl in his ironmongery, symbolizing his profession and craftsmanship."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0082</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WORKSHOP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The workshop is the space where Wilhelm Wöhrl works, filled with tools and the portrait of Christiaan Josi."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0082</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;IRONMONGER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ironmonger is Wilhelm Wöhrl's occupation, involving the crafting and selling of metal goods."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0082</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PORTRAIT FRAME&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ARTIFACT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The ornate frame of the portrait of Christiaan Josi is a significant element, contrasting with the utilitarian surroundings."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0082</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RUSTIC WALLS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ENVIRONMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The rustic walls of Wilhelm Wöhrl's workshop are a setting that adds to the historical and artistic ambiance."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0082</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HOT METAL AND OIL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MATERIAL"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The scent of hot metal and oil in Wilhelm Wöhrl's workshop represents the environment and materials used in his craft."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0082</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DIMLY LIT WORKSHOP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ENVIRONMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The dim lighting in Wilhelm Wöhrl's workshop contributes to the atmosphere and historical setting."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0082</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UTILITARIAN SURROUNDINGS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ENVIRONMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The utilitarian surroundings of Wilhelm Wöhrl's workshop reflect the practical and functional nature of the space."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0082</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DETRITUS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MATERIAL"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Detritus in Wilhelm Wöhrl's workshop includes remnants of his craft, symbolizing the process and history of his work."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0082</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SHARP ANGLES AND PLANES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"VISUAL ELEMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The sharp angles and planes in the portrait of Christiaan Josi reflect the artist's technique and the subject's features."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0082</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PIERCING GAZE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"VISUAL ELEMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The piercing gaze of the subject in the portrait of Christiaan Josi is a notable feature, capturing the subject's essence."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0082</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DIGNIFIED DEMEANOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"VISUAL ELEMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The dignified demeanor of the subject in the portrait of Christiaan Josi reflects the artist's mastery and the subject's character."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0082</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PROVENANCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The provenance of the portrait of Christiaan Josi is meticulously documented, providing insight into its history and value."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0082</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NETHERLANDISH ART&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STYLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Netherlandish art is the style of the portrait of Christiaan Josi, characterized by attention to detail and mastery of light and shadow."&lt;SEP&gt;"Netherlandish art refers to the style and tradition of artworks originating from the Netherlands, known for its captivating and inspiring qualities."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0082</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DUTCH ART SCENE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONTEXT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Dutch art scene of the 17th century is the context in which Pieter Christoffel Wonder worked, influencing his style and reputation."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0082</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PARISIAN HEADQUARTERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Parisian headquarters refers to the physical location of Fondation Custodia in Paris."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0082</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WONDER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Wonder is mentioned as the artist of the portrait, contributing to the collection."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0082</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FONDATION CUSTODIA COLLECTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The collection of Fondation Custodia includes various masterpieces, with the 'Portrait of a man, probably Christiaan Josi' as a centerpiece."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0082</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VISITORS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Visitors are people who come to see the artworks at Fondation Custodia."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0082</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MASTERPIECES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Masterpieces refer to the significant artworks in the collection, including the 'Portrait of a man, probably Christiaan Josi'."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0082</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="&quot;WILHELM WÖHRL&quot;" target="&quot;CHRISTIAAN JOSI&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Wilhelm Wöhrl owns a portrait of Christiaan Josi, treating it with reverence and pride."</data>
      <data key="d5">"ownership, reverence"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0082</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;WILHELM WÖHRL&quot;" target="&quot;PIETER CHRISTOFFEL WONDER&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Wilhelm Wöhrl knows the artist Pieter Christoffel Wonder, who painted the portrait of Christiaan Josi."</data>
      <data key="d5">"knowledge, connection"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0082</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CHRISTIAAN JOSI&quot;" target="&quot;PIETER CHRISTOFFEL WONDER&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Pieter Christoffel Wonder painted the portrait of Christiaan Josi, capturing his likeness and essence."</data>
      <data key="d5">"creation, portrayal"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0082</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CHRISTIAAN JOSI&quot;" target="&quot;FONDATION CUSTODIA&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Fondation Custodia displays the portrait of Christiaan Josi as part of its collection."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Fondation Custodia houses the portrait of Christiaan Josi, preserving it for future generations."</data>
      <data key="d5">"display, representation"&lt;SEP&gt;"preservation, display"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0082</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PIETER CHRISTOFFEL WONDER&quot;" target="&quot;FRIZ LUGT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Friz Lugt collected the portrait of Christiaan Josi, recognizing the artist Pieter Christoffel Wonder's mastery."</data>
      <data key="d5">"collection, recognition"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0082</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FONDATION CUSTODIA&quot;" target="&quot;FRIZ LUGT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Fondation Custodia displays the artwork donated by Friz Lugt as a centerpiece of its collection."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fondation Custodia's collection includes the portrait of Christiaan Josi, which was acquired through the Friz Lugt collection."</data>
      <data key="d5">"acquisition, preservation"&lt;SEP&gt;"donation, display"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0082</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FONDATION CUSTODIA&quot;" target="&quot;PARISIAN HEADQUARTERS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Fondation Custodia operates out of its Parisian headquarters where visitors can view its collection."</data>
      <data key="d5">"location, operation"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0082</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FONDATION CUSTODIA&quot;" target="&quot;PORTRAIT OF A MAN, PROBABLY CHRISTIAAN JOSI&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Portrait of a man, probably Christiaan Josi is a centerpiece of the collection displayed at Fondation Custodia."</data>
      <data key="d5">"display, significance"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0082</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FONDATION CUSTODIA&quot;" target="&quot;WONDER&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Wonder is the artist of the portrait displayed at Fondation Custodia."</data>
      <data key="d5">"creation, display"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0082</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FONDATION CUSTODIA&quot;" target="&quot;VISITORS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Visitors come to see the artworks, including the 'Portrait of a man, probably Christiaan Josi', at Fondation Custodia."</data>
      <data key="d5">"attendance, interest"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0082</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FONDATION CUSTODIA&quot;" target="&quot;MASTERPIECES&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Masterpieces are significant artworks in the collection, with the 'Portrait of a man, probably Christiaan Josi' as a centerpiece."</data>
      <data key="d5">"representation, significance"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0082</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PORTRAIT OF A MAN, PROBABLY CHRISTIAAN JOSI&quot;" target="&quot;NETHERLANDISH ART&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Portrait of a man, probably Christiaan Josi is an example of Netherlandish art, showcasing its enduring power to captivate and inspire."</data>
      <data key="d5">"representation, inspiration"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0082</data>
    </edge>
  </graph>
